    <description>Utility tools for DynamicsCrm.DevKit development. Includes JavaScript/CSS minification via NUglify and code coverage analysis tools for Dynamics 365/Dataverse projects.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Version 4.12.34.56:
- JavaScript and CSS minification using NUglify
- Code coverage analysis integration with Visual Studio Coverage tools
- Utility executable for build automation tasks</releaseNotes>
